  "status": "verified-sample",
  "coverage": "partial",
  "notes": [
    "Partial catalog: program/preview, cut/auto, T-bar, transition style/rate/preview, fade to black, downstream keyers, macros, aux/output, recording and stream start/stop. Upstream keyers, DVE, SuperSource, media player, audio (classic and Fairlight), camera control, multiview, timecode and display clock actions are not catalogued; use the source tree (src/actions/*, src/options/*).",
    "Options are built with factory functions in src/options/*.ts that depend on the connected model (number of M/Es, DSKs, macros, outputs); the catalog records the factory result with dynamic choices as notes.",
    "ME and DSK pickers are 1-based numeric ids. With a single M/E or DSK the picker is hidden and the value is ignored (resolveMixEffectIndex, src/options/mixEffect.ts:33; resolveDownstreamKeyerIndex, src/options/downstreamKeyer.ts:31).",
    "Source pickers use allowInvalidValues, so any non-negative integer up to 32767 is forwarded (parseSourceId, src/options/sources.ts); expressions returning a source number are accepted.",
    "Dropdowns with disableAutoExpression (on/off/toggle, fade easing, macro action) do not accept expressions in the UI.",
    "dskAuto uses the option id 'downstreamKeyerId' while dskOnAir, dskTie, dskRate and dskSource use 'key'.",
    "Built on @companion-module/base ~2.1.3: expressions are supported for option values (see docs/catalog.md)."
  ],
